{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11203220","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11203220","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:3:1120322001:1":{"text":"えっと……それは……それはなぁ……その、なぁ……ワイと約束したやろ……","source_cn":"这个……那个……就是那个嘛……那个，各位都知道的……你...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x404096673C8CDB89","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1120322002:1":{"text":"ごめん、嬉しくって忘れちゃってたよ。報酬に何が欲しいか教えてくれる？","source_cn":"对不起，我只顾着高兴，忘记了。请说，你需要什么报酬？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x02313244CEDAD740","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1120322003:1":{"text":"安心してくれ、約束は反故にしない。","source_cn":"你放心，承诺给你的报酬，我们不会食言。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDDB29F0E5AF21D04","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1120322004:1":{"text":"おやぁ、こんなことを言うのはちょっと恥ずかしいんやけど……","source_cn":"哎呀，这个说来有点不好意思……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1B1DE3C5D494BE7A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1120322005:1":{"text":"このミーアキャット、急に照れ笑いなんかしちゃって、なんか嫌な予感がしますね……","source_cn":"这只狐獴怎么忽然笑得这么羞涩，让我有种不祥的预感……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF823DD8839CDFCEB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_fema